Date: Thu, 18 Sep 2025 15:18:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Recalculate scores from baseline component overrides

## Summary
- compose per-planet habitability and PHI maps from baseline similarities and current overrides before invoking the calculators, passing the same component values for rendering and storage
- extend the ESI and PHI score functions to accept component overrides so zero deltas reproduce the reference values and slider changes recompute from scratch
- refresh the weight recalculation tests to assert the new override-aware behaviour and storage semantics

## Testing
- `pytest -q`
